cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
  It reproduces the layered model of Spooren et al., "PQC-Enhanced QKD
  Networks: A Layered Approach" (arXiv:2604.05599); please cite that paper
  for the model itself.
type: software
title: "PQC-QKD Hybrid Security Layer: Research PoC"
abstract: >-
  A research proof of concept that fuses a simulated QKD key, delivered over
  the ETSI GS QKD 014 REST API, with a post-quantum key into one
  HKDF-SHA3-256-derived key, and rotates it into a WireGuard lane layered as
  in the reference paper and into a strongSwan IKEv2 lane as an RFC 8784
  post-quantum preshared key.
version: 0.2.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/thedaemon-wizard/pqc-qkd-HybridNetwork"
authors:
  - family-names: Koike
    given-names: Amon
keywords:
  - quantum key distribution
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ETSI GS QKD 014
  - WireGuard
  - IKEv2
  - HPKE
